<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Abaseen Studio</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0b1020;
        --bg-soft: #121a2b;
        --panel: rgba(18, 26, 43, 0.9);
        --card: #f4f7ff;
        --text: #eaf2ff;
        --muted: #b8c6e0;
        --primary: #7c9cff;
        --primary-strong: #5d7df6;
        --accent: #9fe7c5;
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        --shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(13, 19, 32, 0.45);
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #17233d, var(--bg) 45%);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        background: rgba(11, 16, 32, 0.72);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 72px;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
        color: #08111d;
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .nav-button {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-strong));
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 84px 0 60px;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 50px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin: 18px 0 20px;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 620px;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 28px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .primary-btn,
      .secondary-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 14px 22px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }

      .primary-btn {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-strong));
        color: white;
      }

      .secondary-btn {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .primary-btn:hover,
      .secondary-btn:hover,
      .nav-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .stats {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        display: flex;
        gap: 32px;
        margin: 42px 0 0;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .stats li {
        min-width: 120px;
      }

      .stats strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .stats span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .mockup {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 26px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .window-bar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .dot {
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .dot.red { background: #ff6b6b; }
      .dot.yellow { background: #ffc857; }
      .dot.green { background: #51d88a; }

      .dashboard {
        background: var(--card);
        color: #1a2335;
        border-radius: 22px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .dashboard-top {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 35, 53, 0.08);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .dashboard-body {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        padding: 20px;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .panel {
        background: #eef3ff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .bars {
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 12px;
        height: 130px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .bars span {
        display: block;
        flex: 1;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--primary), #92a7ff);
      }

      .mini-list {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 18px 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .mini-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        background: rgba(124, 156, 255, 0.12);
        color: var(--primary-strong);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      section {
        padding: 80px 0;
      }

      .section-title {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto 40px;
      }

      .section-title h2 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }

      .section-title p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 26px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 28px 22px;
      }

      .feature-icon {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 14px;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 156, 255, 0.2), rgba(159, 231, 197, 0.2));
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .cta {
        text-align: center;
        padding-bottom: 120px;
      }

      .cta-box {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124, 156, 255, 0.12), rgba(159, 231, 197, 0.08));
        border-radius: 28px;
        padding: 42px 24px;
      }

      .cta-box h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      }

      .cta-box p {
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0 auto 24px;
        max-width: 650px;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 24px 0 48px;
        color: var(--muted);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .footer-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .feature-grid,
        .dashboard-body {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .stats {
          gap: 18px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="container">
        <nav>
          <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-mark">A</span>
            <span>Abaseen</span>
          </div>

          <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          </div>

          <button class="nav-button">Book a call</button>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="home">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Creative digital studio</div>
            <h1>We build brands people remember.</h1>
            <p class="lead">
              From strategy and design to launch-ready websites, we help businesses stand out,
              grow faster, and turn attention into action.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#contact" class="primary-btn">Start your project</a>
              <a href="#services" class="secondary-btn">See our work</a>
            </div>

            <ul class="stats">
              <li>
                <strong>120+</strong>
                <span>projects shipped</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>8 yrs</strong>
                <span>of experience</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>94%</strong>
                <span>client retention</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mockup" aria-label="Dashboard preview">
            <div class="window-bar">
              <span class="dot red"></span>
              <span class="dot yellow"></span>
              <span class="dot green"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard">
              <div class="dashboard-top">
                <span>Growth dashboard</span>
                <span class="tag">+28.4%</span>
              </div>

              <div class="dashboard-body">
                <div class="panel">
                  <small>Traffic overview</small>
                  <div class="bars" aria-label="Bar chart">
                    <span style="height: 52%"></span>
                    <span style="height: 70%"></span>
                    <span style="height: 58%"></span>
                    <span style="height: 85%"></span>
                    <span style="height: 64%"></span>
                    <span style="height: 92%"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="panel">
                  <small>Key wins</small>
                  <ul class="mini-list">
                    <li><span>Leads</span> <strong>+41%</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Sales</span> <strong>+24%</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Engagement</span> <strong>+18%</strong></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-title">
            <div class="eyebrow">Our services</div>
            <h2>Everything you need to launch with confidence.</h2>
            <p>We combine creativity, strategy, and technical delivery to help your business scale.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">✦</div>
              <h3>Brand Strategy</h3>
              <p>Clarify your message, define your audience, and create a stronger market position.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">◈</div>
              <h3>Web Design</h3>
              <p>Modern, conversion-focused websites tailored to your goals and customer journey.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">↗</div>
              <h3>Growth Marketing</h3>
              <p>Improve visibility, generate demand, and turn traffic into measurable business growth.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-title">
            <div class="eyebrow">Why choose us</div>
            <h2>Strategy-first thinking, beautiful execution.</h2>
            <p>
              We work closely with founders and teams to build digital experiences that look great
              and produce real business results.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta-box">
            <div class="eyebrow">Let’s build something great</div>
            <h2>Ready to turn your vision into a standout brand?</h2>
            <p>Tell us about your goals and we’ll help you map the next step with a clear, practical plan.</p>
            <a href="mailto:hello@abaseenstudio.com" class="primary-btn">hello@abaseenstudio.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container footer-row">
        <div>© 2026 Abaseen Studio</div>
        <div>Designing better digital experiences.</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
